  "notes": "Documented conflicts: the catalog names GetMyTranscript.com with a 3-7 business day turnaround and an unstated fee, while the Registrar's records page names the National Student Clearinghouse, a $10.00 fee and three business days; the catalog gives LOA deadlines of Dec 1 / May 1 while the calendar publishes a combined OCS & LOA declaration deadline of 2026-11-02 / 2027-04-01. The START Center link on the Registrar page returned HTTP 404 on 2026-08-31 and is flagged as unusable. sha256 is null for every source. Each page was located and read at its public URL on 2026-08-31, but the network egress available during collection could not re-download raw response bodies for hashing, so no digest is asserted rather than a fabricated one. Agent 5 owns hashing via tools/fetch_sources.py; digests must be populated by that pipeline (or an equivalent unrestricted re-fetch) before this sidecar can pass a schema that requires 64 hex characters. retrieved_at reflects the collection session on 2026-08-31."
